docs {
  # POST /api/sales/done/ — Confirm sale (Round Trip, arrival + departure)

  Same as `post_confirm_one_way.bru` but with `departure_*` fields. Only send departure when `sale.service_type.name=="Round Trip"` (`travels/views.py:193`). Requires `Authorization: Token {{token}}`.

  ## Status codes

  - `200 OK` — sale confirmed, `arrival` + `departure` `Transfer`s created
  - `400 Bad Request` — already paid
  - `401 Unauthorized` — invalid `stripe_code`

  ## Response (200)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Sale confirmed successfully",
    "data": []
  }
  ```

  Creates 2 rows: `Transfer(type="arrival", …)` + `Transfer(type="departure", …)` per `views.py:193-203`.

  ## Notes

  - Departure fields are `required=False` in serializer but required by business when Round Trip — omit for One Way.
}
